<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.5 points to 865.4.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 2.5 points to 865.4.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 2.5 points on Monday to 865.4 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the transport index losing the most, down 12.6 points to 1231.5.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
